   "data": {
    "text": "LAYERS, MASKS & EFFECTS\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 9, CC 81 to 96\n   1 Overlay\n   2 Blend mode\n   3 Cutout and green screen\n   4 Mask\n   5 Tracking\n   6 Video effect\n   7 Effect family\n   8 Copies of the picture\n   9 Light effect\n  10 Body effect\n  11 suite: Documentary\n  12 suite: Heavenly light\n  13 suite: Party edit\n  14 pair: When impacts rise, the picture flashes\n  15 pair: When text labels something, it follows it\n  16 pair: When the feeling turns dreamlike, light blooms\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 9, CC 97 to 97\n   1 pair: When the music is featured, the effects pulse on the beat"
   },
